An usecase Diagram is a diagram which shows interacion between users and the functionalities

it helps to capture the user functionalities and scope

Core components:
user represented with a person diagram

functionality or usecase is defined by a empty oval shape
and the relationship between the user and the functionality is linked with an arrow

and the system is represented by a box in which inside we maintain the users linked with functionalities

dashed arrow represents include and exclude and include is mandatory that usecase is mandatory with the another usecase and exclude is the same but it is optional that usecase is optional while doing th other usecase